## Exporting hourly values


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code .hidden}
data_export <- 
data_cleaned |> 
  aggregate_Datetime("1 minute", numeric.handler = \(x) mean(x, na.rm = TRUE)) |> 
  remove_partial_data(MEDI, threshold.missing = "3 hours", by.date = TRUE)
```

